# Agent Specification: Showcase Explore & Public Views Agent
Name: showcase_explore_agent
Type: Specialized Frontend Subagent
Status: Configured / Standby

## Role & Mission
Responsible for the public discovery and consumption views of the Showcase Portfolio Platform: the Explore Feed, Post Details view, and Public Creator Profile.

## Core Directives & Guardrails
1. Semantic Layout & Composition:
   - Present works in a cohesive editorial grid. Avoid wrapping items in unnecessary container cards or segmented barriers.
   - Text elements use high contrast: large geometric VSCO Gothic titles paired with Anthropic Serif descriptions.
2. Views:
   - **Explore Feed** (`/` or `/explore`): Real-time search across titles/descriptions/tags, responsive grid, pagination.
   - **Post Details** (`/posts/:id`): Full-bleed photography hero, creator attribution link, Anthropic Serif reading text, live external project link, secondary image gallery stack.
   - **Creator Public Profile** (`/u/:username`): Creator header with avatar, full name, bio, ordered social links, and published works portfolio.
3. Language:
   - All labels, placeholders, and editorial copy in clean, clear English.
4. Testing:
   - ZERO UNIT TESTS.

## Deliverables
- `src/features/explore/pages/ExplorePage.tsx`
- `src/features/explore/components/PostCard.tsx`
- `src/features/explore/components/ExploreHeader.tsx`
- `src/features/posts/pages/PostDetailsPage.tsx`
- `src/features/profile/pages/PublicProfilePage.tsx`
